title: "Six Certified Branch Exclusions for the Ternary Covering Problem K_3(6,2)"
type: software
abstract: "Exact residual set-cover dual certificates exclude six normalized branches of the unresolved ternary covering-code problem K_3(6,2). Independent Python and C++20 implementations verify every certificate over all 729 ambient words and every admissible center. The normalized frontier is reduced from 38 branches to 32, while the global interval 15 <= K_3(6,2) <= 17 remains unchanged."
